\pard\sa120\keepn\b\fs34\cf2 Properties of the ColorDialog Control\b0\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab The following are some of the commonly used properties of the ColorDialog control:\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab S.N Property Description\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab 1. AllowFullOpen\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab Gets or sets a value indicating whether the user can use the dialog box to define custom colors.\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab 2. AnyColor\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab Gets or sets a value indicating whether the dialog box displays all available colors in the set of basic colors.\par
\pard\sb520\sa40\keepn\f0\fs18\cf5 SLIDE 13\par
\pard\sa120\keepn\b\fs34\cf2 Properties of the ColorDialog Control (cont.)\b0\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab 3. CanRaiseEvents\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab Gets a value indicating whether the component can raise an event.\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab 4. Color\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab Gets or sets the color selected by the user.\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab 5. CustomColors\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab Gets or sets the set of custom colors shown in the dialog box.\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab 6. FullOpen\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab Gets or sets a value indicating whether the controls used to create custom colors are visible when the dialog box is opened\par
\pard\sb520\sa40\keepn\f0\fs18\cf5 SLIDE 14\par
\pard\sa120\keepn\b\fs34\cf2 Properties of the ColorDialog Control (cont.)\b0\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab 7. ShowHelp\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab Gets or sets a value indicating whether a Help button appears in the color dialog box.\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab 8. SolidColorOnly\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab Gets or sets a value indicating whether the dialog box will restrict users to selecting solid colors only.\par
\pard\sb520\sa40\keepn\f0\fs18\cf5 SLIDE 15\par
\pard\sa120\keepn\b\fs34\cf2 Methods of the ColorDialog Control\b0\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab The following are some of the commonly used methods of the ColorDialog control:\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab S.N Method Name & Description\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab 1. Reset\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab Resets all options to their default values, the last selected color to black, and the custom colors to their default values.\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab 2. RunDialog\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab When overridden in a derived class, specifies a common dialog box.\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab 3. ShowDialog\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab Runs a common dialog box with a default owner.\par
\pard\sb520\sa40\keepn\f0\fs18\cf5 SLIDE 16\par
\pard\sa120\keepn\b\fs34\cf2 Events of the ColorDialog Control\b0\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab The following are some of the commonly used events of the ColorDialog control:\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab S.N Event\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab Description\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab 1. HelpRequest\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab Occurs when the user clicks the Help button on a common dialog box.\par
\pard\sb520\sa40\keepn\f0\fs18\cf5 SLIDE 17\par
\pard\sa120\keepn\b\fs34\cf2 VB.Net - FontDialog Control\b0\par
