\pard\sb520\sa40\keepn\f0\fs18\cf5 SLIDE 34\par
\pard\sa120\keepn\b\fs34\cf2 Properties of the SaveFileDialog Control\b0\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab The following are some of the commonly used properties of the SaveFileDialog control:\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab S.N  Property Description\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab 1. AddExtension\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab Gets or sets a value indicating whether the dialog box automatically adds an extension to a file name if the user omits the extension.\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab 2. CheckFileExists\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab Gets or sets a value indicating whether the dialog box displays a warning if the user specifies a file name that does not exist.\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab 3. CheckPathExists\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab Gets or sets a value indicating whether the dialog box displays a warning if the user specifies a path that does not exist.\par
\pard\sb520\sa40\keepn\f0\fs18\cf5 SLIDE 35\par
\pard\sa120\keepn\b\fs34\cf2 Properties of the SaveFileDialog Control (cont.)\b0\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab 4. CreatePrompt\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab Gets or sets a value indicating whether the dialog box prompts the user for permission to create a file if the user specifies a file that does not exist.\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab 5. DefaultExt\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab Gets or sets the default file name extension.\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab 6. DereferenceLinks\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab Gets or sets a value indicating whether the dialog box returns the location of the file referenced by the shortcut or whether it returns the location of the shortcut (.lnk).\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab 7. FileName\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab Gets or sets a string containing the file name selected in the file dialog box.\par
\pard\sb520\sa40\keepn\f0\fs18\cf5 SLIDE 36\par
\pard\sa120\keepn\b\fs34\cf2 Properties of the SaveFileDialog Control (cont.)\b0\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab 8. FileNames\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab Gets the file names of all selected files in the dialog box.\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab 9. Filter\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab Gets or sets the current file name filter string, which determines the choices that appear in the "Save as file type" or "Files of type" box in the dialog box.\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab 10. FilterIndex\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab Gets or sets the index of the filter currently selected in the file dialog box.\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab 11. InitialDirectory\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab Gets or sets the initial directory displayed by the file dialog box.\par
\pard\sb520\sa40\keepn\f0\fs18\cf5 SLIDE 37\par
\pard\sa120\keepn\b\fs34\cf2 Properties of the SaveFileDialog Control (cont.)\b0\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab 12. OverwritePrompt\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab Gets or sets a value indicating whether the Save As dialog box displays a warning if the user specifies a file name that already exists.\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab 13. RestoreDirectory\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab Gets or sets a value indicating whether the dialog box restores the current directory before closing.\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab 14. ShowHelp\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab Gets or sets a value indicating whether the Help button is displayed in the file dialog box.\par
\pard\sb520\sa40\keepn\f0\fs18\cf5 SLIDE 38\par
\pard\sa120\keepn\b\fs34\cf2 Properties of the SaveFileDialog Control (cont.)\b0\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab 15. SupportMultiDottedExtensions\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab Gets or sets whether the dialog box supports displaying and saving files that have multiple file name extensions.\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab 16. Title\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab Gets or sets the file dialog box title.\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab 17. ValidateNames\par
